# Archive and Evidence Policy

- `HomeFinder.zip` is the only project ZIP.
- No `.zip` files are stored inside this checkpoint.
- `master/` contains the single canonical master scene.
- `reconciliation/` contains recovered census and mapping evidence.
- `03_authority_docs/` contains current/restored authority documents and provenance.
- `04_recovery_archives/` contains flattened historical recovery contents only.
- `verification/` contains verification and audit evidence.
- `active_development/` contains the current editable system and active camera work.
- `07_historical_source_review/` is forensic reference only and never the active authority.
